# Far-ownership A/B at 10k (reports/engine/2026-11-27-society-far-ownership/README.md): 10k civilians
# live their routines while the hero stands alone; `society start` engages the permanent Society pilot
# on the export of the spawned world. The OFF control is this scenario without the `society start` line.
# The society-npc-* name gives a FRAME_PROFILE=ON build in scripts/ryzen.sh.
# @headless
# @timeout 2400
seed 73106
cheat god
world-check NEWWORLD.ZEN
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091
npcscale stats start
npcscale 10000
society start world.json
wait 1500
npcscale stats end
